# ai-monitor · project .gitignore
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated 2026-10-18 after directory flatten (aibench/ai-monitor/ → aibench/).
# Adjust together with README + docs/design.md if the project layout changes.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts (project-specific)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Main binary; every `go build -o ai-monitor` rewrites it.
/ai-monitor
# Historical binary snapshots (e.g. ai-monitor.old2 from a workbuddy rollback).
/ai-monitor.old*

# SQLite runtime database (rewritten on every ai-monitor start).
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Go embed source: synced from web/dist by `make web-build`, then baked into
# the binary via //go:embed. Must NEVER be committed; rebuild generates it.
internal/webui/dist/

# Local web build staging area (mirrors internal/webui/dist during build).
internal/webui/assets-staging/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Go toolchain
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*.test
*.out
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.prof
*.pprof
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
go.work
go.work.sum
vendor/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# web/ has its own .gitignore (node_modules / dist / .vite / *.local) — the
# root file only adds the embed mirror handled above.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE / Editor
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.tmp
*.log

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.Trash-*
.fuse_hidden*
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Workbuddy workspace data (chat history, memory, scratch files)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.workbuddy/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local secrets (avoid accidental commit)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Backup / archive produced by tooling
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tar.gz
*.zip
*.tgz
